<h3><a name=3D"AND"></a>AND - Logical AND</h3>

<p>A,Z,N =3D A&amp;M</p>

<p>A logical AND is performed, bit by bit, on the accumulator
contents using the contents of a byte of memory.</p>

<p>Processor Status after use:</p>

<p><table height=3D"171" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" width=3D"450" =
border=3D"1">
  <tbody><tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#C">C</a></td>
    <td width=3D"35%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#C">Carry Flag</a></td>
    <td width=3D"180">Not affected</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
