    <td width=3D"35%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#Z">Zero Flag</a></td>
    <td width=3D"180">Set if A =3D 0</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
