<h3><a name=3D"LSR"></a>LSR - Logical Shift Right</h3>

<p>A,C,Z,N =3D A/2 or M,C,Z,N =3D M/2</p>

<p>Each of the bits in A or M is shift one place to the right.
The bit that was in bit 0 is shifted into the carry flag. Bit
7 is set to zero.</p>

<p>Processor Status after use:</p>

<p><table height=3D"171" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" width=3D"450" =
border=3D"1">
