</p><h3><a name=3D"ORA"></a>ORA - Logical Inclusive OR</h3>

<p>A,Z,N =3D A|M</p>

<p>An inclusive OR is performed, bit by bit, on the accumulator
contents using the contents of a byte of memory.</p>

