<h3><a name=3D"SBC"></a>SBC - Subtract with Carry</h3>

<p>A,Z,C,N =3D A-M-(1-C)</p>

<p>This instruction subtracts the contents of a memory location
to the accumulator together with the not of the carry bit. If
overflow occurs the carry bit is clear, this enables multiple
byte subtraction to be performed.</p>

<p>Processor Status after use:</p>

<p><table height=3D"171" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" width=3D"450" =
border=3D"1">
  <tbody><tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#C">C</a></td>
    <td width=3D"45%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#C">Carry Flag</a></td>
    <td width=3D"50%">Clear if overflow in bit 7</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#Z">Z</a></td>
    <td width=3D"45%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#Z">Zero Flag</a></td>
    <td width=3D"50%">Set if A =3D 0</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#I">I</a></td>
    <td width=3D"45%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#I">Interrupt Disable</a></td>
    <td width=3D"50%">Not affected</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#D">D</a></td>
    <td width=3D"45%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
registers.html#D">Decimal Mode Flag</a></td>
    <td width=3D"50%">Not affected</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=3D"MIDDLE" width=3D"5%" height=3D"24"><a href=3D"https://www.=
nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/registers.html#B">B</a></td>
    <td width=3D"45%"><a href=3D"https://www.nesdev.org/obelisk-6502-guide/=
