<h3><a name=3D"SEC"></a>SEC - Set Carry Flag</h3>

<p>C =3D 1</p>

<p>Set the carry flag to one.</p>

<p><table height=3D"171" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" width=3D"450" =
border=3D"1">
  <tbody><tr>
